#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Block 113: exact paired-floor refutation and mixed Pythagorean circle.

An exact paired branch has negative-count split (0,1), hence paired sum one,
and its positive self sectors assemble to inertia (15,1,0).  Independently,
a pinned circulant square root C anticommutes with the Block 109 dressing A*,
so t C + s A* is an involution exactly on t^2+s^2=1.  Three rational
interior points have inertia (8,8,0), while the pure-C endpoint has rank
twelve and inertia (6,6,4).  The paired zero-sum question remains open.
"""

